# The `this` arm of the pass-over refusal over a map of scalars, inside a block over the member with a long
# real query: `Settings` holds `Mode` and `Level`, both passed over, and lacks both keys, so the filter is
# refused; the console shows the whole text, the definition of `X` and the one-object remedy first.
rule r {
    Resources.WebServer.Properties.Configuration.Settings {
        this[ ServerSideEncryptionConfiguration !exists LoggingConfiguration !exists ] empty
    }
}
